{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Lost Child is a walking simulator and horror game with survival elements.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse Yourself in a Nightmare With No Escape</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Andrey wakes up in an endless maze of corridors.</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They seem vaguely familiar, but his memory is wiped, and reality distorts with every step. Voices from the darkness, children's screams, sinister shadows \u2014 what is this? Hallucinations, memories, or someone's cruel experiment?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540530/extras/4c3af7a434cc99e29f86dd568d001909.poster.avif?t=1761802737\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540530/extras/4c3af7a434cc99e29f86dd568d001909.webm?t=1761802737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540530/extras/4c3af7a434cc99e29f86dd568d001909.mp4?t=1761802737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every movement changes the environment. Behind closed doors lies a truth Andrey doesn\u2019t want to remember. But you can't run from the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to remember what can\u2019t be forgotten?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540530/extras/4a61907c78e1b2f7f7ed530448bd76d4.poster.avif?t=1761802737\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540530/extras/4a61907c78e1b2f7f7ed530448bd76d4.webm?t=1761802737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540530/extras/4a61907c78e1b2f7f7ed530448bd76d4.mp4?t=1761802737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological horror with a deep narrative</strong> \u2013 Uncover a dark mystery by piecing together fragments of the past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A shifting world</strong> \u2013 The corridors have a life of their own, twisting and adapting to the protagonist's fears.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>References to real events</strong> \u2013 Subtle details that will make you think twice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive sound design</strong> \u2013 Whispers behind your back, echoes of footsteps, and haunting noises pull you deeper into the atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photorealistic graphics</strong> \u2013 Powered by Unreal Engine 5.4, the horror feels closer than ever before</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Attention to Detail","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3540530/af7aeb2338a0e95fce19dcb11a48d1e70b726ebd.jpg"},{"name":"Jump!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3540530/84a99cb2bb6bb631e1184141237c602a0c85b591.jpg"},{"name":"Don't Blink","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3540530/7af751b6b5f39b6791a85e83f7e4793669ca2acf.jpg"},{"name":"Under Watch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3540530/c723dd5398b538d917bfca00c930d4aeba4fdd22.jpg"},{"name":"Confession","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3540530/ecd809a21d1747036cfb3e4b423f16dc67dcc5dc.jpg"},{"name":"Denial","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3540530/837a58b0fc03b